<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">1Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uakulivanga ua Paulu kuli vaka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uakulivanga ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda uakulivanga ku vaka Tesalonika vausonekele kuli Kanganda Paulu (1:1) Uasa kupua mukanda uakulivanga uje Paulu uasonekele kupua mbazuvuila ya Mbimbiliya kaha ua usonekele kusetekesa ha miaka makumi atanu naumo (51) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Paulu uakele mu Kolinte mukemo muasonekelele mukanda uaku cikungulukilo caku Tesalonika, cikungulukilo caputukile ha vungenzi vuendi vua mucivali vua kutuala Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi (Vilinga 17:1-10) Mu Livulu lia Vilinga lihandeka ngualio mu cikungulukilo muakele Vayunda vamo na Vangelengu vavengi. Paulu kasele kutumama ntsimbu yalaha mu Tesalonika, hanima ya kuputuka cikungulukilo, kaha uatumine ou mukanda mu kukolesa vaka kutsiliela kuje. Mukanda ou uli na mitue yaingi hamo na vishika vije muvanapandele kuyoya vaka Kilistu. Paulu alina kuhaka mana cikuma ha kuija ca Kilistu ca mucivali. Nankuma, vaka kutsiliela vaku Tesalonika vavuahelele ha mutue ou. Paulu ualikuasesele kuija ca Kilistu ca mucivali linga vayoye vuyoye vuje vuvuahelesa Njambi 5:6-8</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka mu mukanda ou na kumeneka cikungulukilo na kutsantsela Njambi hali vakevo 1</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Kaha alumbununa ha vilinga na muzimbu uje uanehele Timateo 2:3</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako Paulu ahana vishika mu vanapandela kuyoyelamo vaka Kilistu mu ceke hakuija ca Yesu ca mucivali 4:1—5:15</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paulu amanusula mukumeneka cikungulukilo naua na kuvalomba linga voshe vatande ou mukanda 5:16-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Yange Paulu na Siluvanasi na Timateo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ku vantu va cikungulukilo ca mu Tesalonika, vaje vanakundama kuli Njambi Tate na Muene Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale neni.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahana citsantselo kuli Njambi ha muono na lutsilielo lua vaka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Ntsimbu yoshe tukatsantsela kuli Njambi hali yeni voshe, kaha naua ntsimbu yoshe tukamilombelela. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Tukavuluka ku mesho a Njambi yetu na Tatetu muje mumunahaka lutsilielo lueni mu vipangi, na muje cizango ceni cili nakumihundanganesa, na muje kutsiliela ceni mukukola ngoo muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Vamuanetu, tuazivuka nguetu Njambi ua mizanga naua namihangula kupua mu vendi, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />muomu tuaminehelele Muzimbu Uacili, keti na mezi lika, vuno honi na nzili na Cimbembesi Uakulela, kaha na lukakateya lua vusunga vuavio. Muazivuka muje vati tuayoyele omo tuakele hamo neni, eci capuile ngeci muomu yeni. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Muatemunuisile yetu na Muene, kaha cipue vene muayandele cikuma, vuno honi muatambuile muzimbu na nzolela ije ikahumu kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Nankuma, yeni muapuile cimueso kuli voshe vaka kutsiliela mu Masendoniya na mu Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Muomu keti lika ngue lizi lia Muene liahumine kuli yeni mu Masendoniya na mu Akaya houe, vuno honi muzimbu ua lutsilielo lueni muli Njambi unashandokela kuoshe. Nankuma, nacimo cahi cituasa kuhandeka. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Vantu va kucihela kuje vakele nakuhandeka muje vati yeni muatutambuile omo tuezile nakumimona, kaha naua na muje vati muatengulukile kuhuma ku tumponia nakuija kuli Njambi, nakupangela Njambi ua vusunga uakuyoya, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />nakuvandamena Munendi omo akeja kuhuma muilu, Munendi Yesu, uje yasanguile ku vatsi, naua ikeye uje akatupatula ku vutenu vua Njambi vuje vulinakuija.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Paulu mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Muomu yeni vavenia vamuanetu muazivuka ngueni nkuma kumeneka cetu kuli yeni kucapuile cangoco. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Muazivuka vati muje vatuyandesele nakutushaula mu Filipi ntsimbu kanda tuije kuli yeni mu Tesalonika. Kaha cipue vene kuakele kutuluisa cakama, Njambi yetu uatukolesele mukumiambuluila Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Kulomba cetu kuli yeni kucemanene ha vutumbe vuakusevuisa cipue ha matumbe a mapi, cipue kukuisa muntu umo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Vuno honi vintsimbu vioshe tulina kuhandeka ngue muje Njambi atonda linga tulinge, muomu natutavesa yetu ngeci catupande kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili. Kututondo kueseka kuvuahelesa vantu, vuno honi kuvuahelesa Njambi uje muka kueseka mitima yetu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Muazivuka muacili ngueni kutuezile kuli yeni mukuhandeka viakuzembeleka, cipue kulikuasesa mezi akumifuikafuika a cipululu, Njambi ikeye mukaleho uetu! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Kutuatondele linga vatushangazale kuli muntu umo houe, cipue kuli yeni cipue kuli veka, cipue vene ngue tunganda va Kilistu ngue tuasele kumihana citeli. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Vuno honi tuakele na ngozi omo tuakele neni hamo, ngue cisemi ua mpuevo omo alinakulela vana vendi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Muomu ha cizango cetu kuli yeni, tualivuaheselele linga tulipangezele neni hamo keti lika Muzimbu Uacili uakuhuma kuli Njambi vuno honi na miono yetu naua. Muomu yeni muapuile vaje vatuazanga cikuma! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Muavusunga vene vulukeni vamuanetu, vati muje tuapangele nakuhundangana! Tuapangele vutsiki na mutania linga keti tupue citeli kuli yeni tele tuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi kuli yeni.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Yeni munapu vakaleho vetu, na Njambi naua na ikeye napu mukaleho ngeci miono yetu ku mesho eni vaka kutsiliela yapuile yakulela, ya vusunga nakuhona mulonga. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Muazivuka ngueni yetu tuapangesele umo na umo ueni ngue visemi vapangesa vana vavo vavenia. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Tuamikolesele, tuamizembelekele nakumisindiya linga muyoye yoyesi ije ivuahelesa Njambi, uje alinakumisana linga mulipangezele hamo Vumuene vuendi vavenia na vumpau.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Naua kuli cuma cikuavo muomu vika ntsimbu yoshe tukatsantsela kuli Njambi. Omo tuaminehelele lizi lia Njambi, yeni mualiuvuile nakulitambula, keti ngue lizi liakuhuma ku vantu vuno honi ngue lizi lia Njambi, lije linapu lizi lia Njambi vene. Muomu Njambi alinakupanga hakati keni vaje vanatsiliela. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Vamuanetu, yeni muatemunuisile vikungulukilo via Njambi mu Yundeya, vije vili muli Kilistu Yesu. Muayandele na mapakeso akuhuma ku vantu veni ngue muje Vayunda mu vayandeselele vikungulukilo, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />vaje vatsihile Muene Yesu na tunanguizi, nakutupakesa yetu. Vakevo kuve kuvuahelesa Njambi! Vapua vitozi ku vantu voshe! <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Vesekele kutuvindika kuambulula lizi kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga na vakevo vatambule kuovoka. Mu ngila eyi vene vakevo vanashulisa vene seteko ya vipi vije vivalingile ntsimbu yoshe, vuno honi vutenu vua Njambi hakukotoka vuneja hali vakevo!<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ashunguiya kuvameneka naua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ngue hali yetu vamuanetu, omo tualihangunukile neni mu kantsimbu kakandende lika, keti mu viyongola vietu houe, vuno honi ku muvila uantsitu lika, tuatondele kumimona cikuma kaha tuahundanganene na kueseka kumimona naua! <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Tuatondele kuhiluka kuli yeni. Yange vene Paulu njesekele cikuma kuhiluka lualuingi vuno honi Satana katutavesele. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nankuma, hangavene munapu yeni, keti veka houe, vaje vanapu kutsiliela cetu na nzolela yetu na cilongo cije tukalihalesa ha kuhiana ku mesho a Muene uetu Yesu omo akeja. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Cilivene, yeni munapu kulihalesa cetu na nzolela yetu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Mukumanusula, omo kutuasele kutualelelaho kulinga cuma coshe ha kumimona, kaha tuayonguele linga vatuseze mu Atena likalietu lika. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Tele tunatumu Timateo, muanetu uje muka kupanga netu mu vipangi via Njambi mu kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. Tuamutumine mukumikolesa nakumikuasa ha lutsilielo lueni, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />linga naumo uahi ua hali yeni akahiluke munima muomu ha mapakeso aua. Yeni vavenia muazivuka ngueni mapakeso aua anapu aku cizango ca Njambi hali yetu. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Tele ha ntsimbu ije tuakele hamo neni, tuamilekelele vualumo nguetu tukauana mapakeso, ngue muje mumuzivukila, evi vikevio cilivene vialingiuile. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Eci cikeco cinjatuminine Timateo. Muomu kunjasele kutualelelaho naua, nankuma, njamutumine linga akumone vati lutsilielo lueni mulunapu. Muavusunga vene kucapuile ngue Liyavolo namieseka, kaha ngue vipangi vietu vioshe viapuile viangoco!<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Vuno honi Timateo nahiluka kuno, kaha natuleka muzimbu uacili ha lutsilielo lueni na cizango ceni. Natuleka nguendi ntsimbu yoshe mulina kutuvuluka, kaha mulina kutonda kutumona ngue naua muje yetu tulina kutonda kumimona. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Muomu ha cuma eci, mu makalu etu oshe na tuyando tuetu, tuakele nakulikolesa muomu yeni vamuanetu. Lutsilielo lueni lukeluo luatukolesele, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Honi tuyoya nga yeni muimana ngoo mu vuyoye vueni muli Muene. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Honi tuhonoua vati kutsantsela Njambi cikuma muomu yeni. Tulina kumutsantsela ha nzolela ije tulinayo ku mesho endi muomu yeni. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Vutsiki na mutania tulina kumulomba na mitima yetu yoshe linga atutavese kumimona mesho na mesho nakumihana vije vimunahonoua mu lutsilielo lueni.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Honi Njambi yetu na Tatetu na Muene uetu Yesu vatuvuahesele ngila linga tuije nakumimona! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Honi Muene akolese cizango ceni kuli umo na mukuavo na ku vantu voshe nakucipuisa cakama ngue muje mucinafu cizango cetu kuli yeni. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Mu ngila eyi vene akakolesa mitima yeni, kaha mukapua vakuhona katoma na kulela ku mesho a Njambi yetu na Tatetu omo Muene uetu Yesu akeja na voshe vaka kulela vendi.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Vuyoye vuje vuvuahelelesa Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Mukumanusula, vamuanetu, tumilomba nakumisindiya muli Muene Yesu, nguetu ngue muje mu mualilongesele kuli yetu vati muje munapande kuyoya linga muvuahelese Njambi. Ngue muje mumuli nakulinga. Lingeni muje vene na kuvuezelelaho cikuma. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Muomu muazivuka vishika vituamihanene kuhitila mu nzili yakama ya Muene Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Njambi atonda linga mupue vakulela na kupatuka ku vukoyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Muntu na muntu kuli yeni vamala napande kuzivuka vati muje napande kuyoya na mpueyendi mu ngila yakulela na kasingimiko, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />keti na vukoyi, ngue vakakuhona kutsiliela vaje kuvazivuka Njambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mucifua eci vene, naumo uahi ueni napande kulinga muamupi kuli muanaye ua yala cipue ua mpuevo cipue kuvazangamena. Tuaminanguile laja ha cuma eci, kaha tuaminanguile na nzili nguetu Muene akahana kashitiko kuli vaje vakalingi evi. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Njambi katusanene linga tuyoye mu vukoyi, vuno honi mu kulela. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nankuma, uoshe uje aviana vilongesa evi kaviana muntu, vuno honi aviana Njambi uje akamihana Cimbembesi uendi Uakulela.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Kutuapandele kumisonekela via cizango kuli umo na mukuavo. Muomu yeni vavenia Njambi uamilongesele vati muje munapande kulizanga umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Kaha munakala nakulinga ngeci kuli vaka kutsiliela voshe mu Masendoniya muoshe. Nankuma tumilomba vamuanetu, vuezeleleniko cikuma. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Pueni vaka kuyoya mukuholoka, hakeni mana eni ku viuma vieni, nakupanga viakulikuasa navio yeni vavenia, ngue muje tuamilekele laja. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Mu ngila eyi vene, mukatambula kasingimiko kuli vaje keti vaka kutsiliela, kaha kumu kayoyela hali muntu umo kuli vije munajena.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Muene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Vamuanetu, tutonda muzivuke vusunga hali vaje vanatsi, linga keti mukale navusiua, ngue vaje kuvesi nakutsiliela. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Muomu tunatsiliela nguetu Yesu uatsile, kaha uasangukile naua, kaha tunatsiliela nguetu Njambi akaneha hamo na Yesu vaje vatsile mukutsiliela kuli ikeye.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Evi tumilongesa hano vinapu vilongesa via Muene linga yetu vaje vacili nakuyoya ha litangua lije Muene akeja kutukatuama kulutue lua vaje vanatsi. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Kukakala mutambi ua lizi liakama liakushika, lizi lia kangelo uakama, nakuohia ca tolombita ya Njambi, kaha Muene ikeye vavenia akashuluka kuhuma muilu. Kaha vaje vatsile mukutsiliela kuli Kilistu vaka sangukila ku muono ha kulivanga, <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />ambahoni yetu vaje tucilinakuyoya ha ntsimbu ije vakatukunguluila hamo navo mu mashelua nakuliuana na Muene havukambuila. Kaha tukakala hamo na Muene ntsimbu yoshe ya yaye. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nankuma, likoleseni umo namukuavo na mezi aua.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Livuaheseleni vualumo ha kuija ca Muene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Vamuanetu, kutuapandele kumisonekela ha vintsimbu na miaka omo viuma evi vikalingiua. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Muomu yeni vavenia muazivuka ngueni Litangua lia Muene likeja ngue muje muizi akeji vutsiki. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Omo vantu vahandeka nguavo, “Viuma vioshe vili muacili nakuholoka kuluu,” ambahoni hajevene kunonga kukavauana! Hajevene cikeja ngue mushongo ua mpuevo atonda kusema, kaha vantu kuvakasa kuteua. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Vuno honi yeni vamuanetu, kumuesi mu milima, kaha Litangua lije keti likamikasumune ngue muizi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Yeni voshe muapua vantu vaje vanakundama ku ceke, vaje vanakundama ku mutania. Yetu kutuakundamene ku vutsiki cipue ku milima houe. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Nankuma, kutuapandele kukosa tulo ngue veka, tunapande kutona nakulihilula. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ikapu ntsimbu ya vutsiki omo vantu vakosa tulo, naua ikapu ntsimbu ya vutsiki omo vantu vakapende. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Vuno honi yetu tuakundama ku mutania, kaha tunapande kulihilula. Tunapande kuzala lutsilielo na cizango ngue ntelo ya hantulo, nakuzala kutsiliela ca kuovoka cetu ngue tepa. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Njambi katuhanguile kuyandela vutenu vuendi, vuno honi linga tukatambule kuovoka kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />uje uatutsililile linga tukayoye hamo nendi, cipue tuyoya cipue tutsa omo akeja. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Nankuma, tulikoleseni umo na mukuavo nakulikuasa umo na mukuavo, ngue muje mumuli nakulinga hano.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika via mamanusuilo na vihindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Vamuanetu, tumilomba nguetu haneni kasingimiko kacili kuli vaje vali nakupanga hakati keni, vaje vamituamenena nakumishika mukuyoya cavu Kilistu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Pangeni navo nakasingimiko kakama na cizango, muomu ha vipangi vije valinakulinga. Pueni vaka ciyulo hakati keni.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Vamuanetu, tumisindiya nguetu munangule vilenda, koleseni vipapoke, kuaseni vaka kuzeya, pueni vaka kusimpa ku muntu uoshe. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Taleni ngeci keti kukale umo ahiluisa vupi ku vupi, vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe pueni vakakulinga muacili kuli umo namukuavo na ku vantu voshe.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Pueni vaka nzolela ntsimbu yoshe, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />tsantseleni mu viuma vioshe. Eci cikeco catonda Njambi mukuyoya ceni mu vumo muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Keti muzime Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />keti musembulule mezi a tunanguizi. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Pueni vakakueseka viuma vioshe, kaha niungeni vije vinapu viacili, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />kaha teueni viuma vioshe via vipi.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Honi Njambi uje mukakutuhana ciyulo amipuise vaka kulela mu vioshe, kaha aniunge vuntu vueni vuoshe vua cimbembesi, na muono na muvila, kuakuhona milonga yoshe hakuija ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Uje namisana akacilinga, muomu uapua uakulongua.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Vamuanetu, netu tulombeleleni naua.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Hinduiseni voshe vaka kutsiliela nakulitsemba ca kulela.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Njimilambelela na nzili yakama ya Muene kutanda mukanda ou ku mesho a vaka kutsiliela voshe.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu kakale hamo neni.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>